BT /F2 11.00 Tf 0 g 48.00 527.00 Td (Do not invent user or chat ids. requests.http has one call for every endpoint below.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0 g 48.00 510.00 Td (GET  /health) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf 0 g 48.00 495.50 Td (No body. 200 when Postgres and Firestore are up. redis may be down. 503 if either required store is) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf 0 g 48.00 482.50 Td (down.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0 g 48.00 463.50 Td (POST  /users) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf 0 g 48.00 449.00 Td (Body: { "name", "email"? }. 201 { user: { id, name, email, createdAt } }.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0 g 48.00 430.00 Td (GET  /users) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf 0 g 48.00 415.50 Td (No body. { users } in created order.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0 g 48.00 396.50 Td (GET  /users/:userId) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf 0 g 48.00 382.00 Td (No body. { user }. 404 if the id does not exist.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0 g 48.00 363.00 Td (POST  /chat/create) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf 0 g 48.00 348.50 Td (Body: { "userAId", "userBId" }. Always returns chatId. Same pair, either order, is the same chat. First) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf 0 g 48.00 335.50 Td (call is 201, the next is 200. Body: { chatId, type: "direct", memberIds, created }.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0 g 48.00 316.50 Td (POST  /chat/group) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf 0 g 48.00 302.00 Td (Body: { "creatorId", "title", "memberIds" }. 201 { chatId, type: "group", title, memberIds, created }.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf 0 g 48.00 289.00 Td (Needs at least two people, at most 200.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0 g 48.00 270.00 Td (GET  /chat/:chatId) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf 0 g 48.00 255.50 Td (Query: userId \(required\). Chat, members, and roles. Caller must be an active member.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0 g 48.00 236.50 Td (PATCH  /chat/:chatId) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf 0 g 48.00 222.00 Td (Body: { "actorId", "title" }. Rename a group. Admin only. { chatId, title }.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0 g 48.00 203.00 Td (POST  /chat/:chatId/members) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf 0 g 48.00 188.50 Td (Body: { "actorId", "userId" }. 201. Add a group member. Admin only. Direct chats reject this.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0 g 48.00 169.50 Td (PATCH  /chat/:chatId/members/:userId) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf 0 g 48.00 155.00 Td (Body: { "actorId", "role" }. role is admin or member. The last admin cannot be demoted.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0 g 48.00 136.00 Td (DELETE  /chat/:chatId/members/:userId) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf 0 g 48.00 121.50 Td (Body: { "actorId" }. Remove someone else. Use leave to remove yourself.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0 g 48.00 102.50 Td (POST  /chat/:chatId/leave) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf 0 g 48.00 88.00 Td (Body: { "userId" }. { chatId, userId, left, promotedUserId }. If the last admin leaves, the) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf 0 g 48.00 75.00 Td (longest-standing other member is promoted.) Tj ET
endstream
